{"articleNo":"56664","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=56664&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012년도『LINC사업단 산학공동연구과제』지원 공고","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.06.08","hit":"4421","attachments":[{"name":"붙임2_산학공동연구과제 운영지침(양식포함).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=56664&attachNo=69047"},{"name":"붙임1_2012년도 『산학협력선도대학(LINC)사업단 산학공동과제』지원공고.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=56664&attachNo=69095"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>지역 전력산업 발전을 위해 대학의 연구 및 기술개발자원을 활용하여 기업의 기술경쟁력 향상을 위하여 산학협력선도대학(LINC)사업단에서는 산학공동연구과제 지원사업을 다음과 같이 공고합니다.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1. 신청분야<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ­ 관련분야의 소재/부품, 기기/장치, 활용/최적화 관련 신기술 개발 과제</p><p><!--StartFragment--><!--StartFragment--></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\" height=\"16\" valign=\"center\" width=\"147\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">신청분야</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\" height=\"16\" valign=\"center\" width=\"361\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">세부 신청과제</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"34\" valign=\"center\" width=\"147\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">녹색기술산업(6)&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"34\" valign=\"center\" width=\"361\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">신재생에너지, 탄소저감 에너지, 고도 물처리, LED 응용, 그린수송</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">시스템, 첨단 그린도시 첨단융합산업 </span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"34\" valign=\"center\" width=\"147\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">첨단융합사업(5)&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"34\" valign=\"center\" width=\"361\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">방송통신융합산업, IT융합시스템, 로봇 응용, 신소재-나노 융합, </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">바이오제약(자원)-의료기기</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"16\" valign=\"center\" width=\"147\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">고부가가치서비스산업(2)&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"16\" valign=\"center\" width=\"361\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">글로벌 헬스케어, 콘텐츠·소프트웨어</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"16\" valign=\"center\" width=\"147\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">특성화 분야(2)</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"16\" valign=\"center\" width=\"361\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">IT융합, 태양광 및 수소연료전지</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. 과제내용<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 사업화 기술개발 과제<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ­ 지원대상 분야 중 R&amp;D를 통해 개발 완료된 기술을 활용하여 사업화가 가능한 산학협력 연구개발과제<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 원천기술개발 / 상품화기술개발 과제<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ­ 지원대상 분야 중 상품화가 가능한 산학협력 연구개발과제로 연구개발 종료후 상품 및 매출실적, 참여학생 고용 등의 구체적인 사업성과를 제시할 수 있는 연구과제</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3. 지원규모 및 사업기간<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 지원규모 : 과제당 5천만원이하(국비) + 산업체 대응자금 25%(현금 10%, 현물 15%)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 지원과제중 금오공대 특성화 분야(IT융합, 태양광 및 연료전지 분야) 50%이상 선정예정<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 연구기간 : 2012년 7월 ～ 2013년 1월(7개월) </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 4. 신청방법 및 유의사항 : [붙임1]참조 </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 5. 접수 및 제출서류<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 신청서 및 사업계획서 접수 : 2012. 6. 7(목) ∼ 6. 20(수) 18:00까지<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (당일 도착분에 한함)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 제출방법 : 방문접수(FAX, E-mail 접수 불가)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 다. 제출서류<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ­ 산학협력선도대학(LINC)사업단 산학공동연구과제 신청서 및 사업계획서 1부 <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ­ 산학공동연구과제 참여의사확인서 및 대응자금출자확약서 1부</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 6. 문의처<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 주&nbsp; 소 : 금오공과대학교 산학협력선도대학(LINC)사업단 행정실 <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 위&nbsp; 치 : 금오공과대학교 그린에너지관 401호<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 다. 담당자 : 지연정(전화 : 054-478-7966/팩스 : 054-478-7969/e-mail : <a href=\"mailto:linc@kumoh.ac.kr\">linc@kumoh.ac.kr</a> ) </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>붙임&nbsp; 1. 2012년도『산학협력선도대학(LINC)사업단 산학공동과제』지원공고 1부. <br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. 산학공동연구과제 운영지침(양식포함) 1부.&nbsp; 끝. </p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
